   "proposition": "The English step 1 says to reduce/slice the original data frame to only the rows for analysis; the Russian says to reduce it to two rows ('до двух строк'), a count the English never states and that the code beside it contradicts (obs_keep groups by name and slice_max(encounter, n = 1) yields one row per person, i.e. eight rows, not two).",
